Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:17.00,overtake - staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}翻译＆校对：阿罗双车退赛笑哈哈  时后：萌新时刻准备摆烂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.27,0:00:10.41,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,春永先生  你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:11.84,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,能听见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:14.13,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,春永先生  能动吗  能听见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.42,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,春永先生  春永先生
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,——OP——
Comment: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:21.34,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,template char,!retime("line",-300,50)!{\pos($scenter,$smiddle)\an5\1a&Hff\3a&HFF\4a&HFF\t(!$scenter-($sleft/2)!,!$scenter-($sleft/2)+50!,\1a&HFF\3a&H00\4a&H00)\t(!$scenter-($sleft/2)+200!,!$scenter-($sleft/2)+300!,\1a&H00\3a&Hff\bord0\4a&H00)}
Comment: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:21.34,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,template char,!retime("line",-300,50)!{\pos($scenter,$smiddle)\an5\1a&HFF\3a&HFF\4a&HFF\t(!$scenter-($sleft/2)!,!$scenter-($sleft/2)+50!,\1a&HFF\3a&H00\4a&H00)\t(!$scenter-($sleft/2)+200!,!$scenter-($sleft/2)+300!,\1a&H00\3a&Hff\bord0\4a&H00)}
Comment: 0,0:00:54.49,0:01:01.05,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,Blowing in the wind… waiting for the time to start…
Comment: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:07.64,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,急な雨に遭って　水平線は煙った
Comment: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:14.19,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,見果てぬ　夢のかたちも
Comment: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:22.66,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,欠けたなにかを　それでも抱く期待を
Comment: 0,0:01:22.82,0:01:28.73,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,この手に　離さぬままで
Comment: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:35.62,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,通り過ぎてく曖昧な毎日も　かけがえのない
Comment: 0,0:01:35.71,0:01:38.57,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,軌跡だって　もう知ってるから
Comment: 0,0:01:38.57,0:01:46.01,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,待ち続けるより　手を伸ばせば　そこに未来
Comment: 0,0:01:46.01,0:01:53.38,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,さあ　どんな今日にさえ　明日が来て　僕ら進んできただろう
Comment: 0,0:01:53.55,0:02:00.98,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,曇天の日々だって　終わりが来て　青天がのぞくだろう
Comment: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:08.35,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,声なき声が今も聞こえている
Comment: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:16.28,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,名もなき風が髪を揺らす
Comment: 0,0:00:54.49,0:01:01.05,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,无论今天如何  明天依旧到来  我们仍会前进
Comment: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:07.64,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,突然降下的雨  让地平线模糊不清
Comment: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:14.19,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,一并模糊了那未曾实现的梦想
Comment: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:22.66,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,即便缺少了什么  但也依然抱有期待
Comment: 0,0:01:22.82,0:01:28.73,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,紧紧抓着这双手一刻不曾放开
Comment: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:35.62,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,共同度过的暧昧每一天  同样不可缺少
Comment: 0,0:01:35.71,0:01:38.57,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,往后的轨迹  其实早已知晓
Comment: 0,0:01:38.57,0:01:46.01,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,与其一直等待  不如伸手去触及未来
Comment: 0,0:01:46.01,0:01:53.38,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,无论今天如何  明天依旧到来  我们仍会前进
Comment: 0,0:01:53.55,0:02:00.98,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,阴翳的日子总会过去  之后便是晴天
Comment: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:08.35,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,不曾发出的声音  如今也已经知晓
Comment: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:16.28,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,那没有名字的风  吹动着你的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:27.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,还好春永没事啊  撞车撞得这么严重
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:31.43,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,才不是没事啦  早月他都骨折了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:34.45,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我是指还好他只是骨折
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.77,0:02:38.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那个情况  说不定会有更严重的后果呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.69,0:02:43.22,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是他暂时没法回到赛车场了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:47.19,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,这个赛季估计很难再继续跑了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:56.08,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是的  别哭啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:57.81,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:05.42,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,话说  你既然这么担心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:07.37,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,就去探望一下他呗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:09.73,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,探望？谁去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:12.88,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我去？不行不行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:15.17,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,要是可以的话我就不会这么烦恼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:18.70,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我根本不知道该跟他说什么好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.95,0:03:21.89,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,虽然平时也不知道说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:24.96,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你不是想支持他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:27.10,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,直接告诉他不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:31.56,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,直接  直接…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:34.96,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,就是这样就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.41,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我每次都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:39.34,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,怎么了  锢太
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.57,0:03:41.04,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:48.05,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,话说  锢太你收到联系了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:50.93,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,联系？谁的联系
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:52.54,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,孝哉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.37,0:03:54.86,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,啊  小真贺吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:57.41,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,话说最近没跟他联系啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:04:01.48,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,从什么时候开始的？我想想…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:03.86,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,上次比赛结束之后就一直没联系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:05.12,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,悠你也是？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:05.89,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.59,0:04:07.93,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.78,0:04:11.24,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那之后他也没到这里来过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:14.81,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我说悠  那时候的事你跟他道歉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:16.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:18.42,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,之前比赛前开的小会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:21.48,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你们不是有点吵起来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:25.04,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,才没有…吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.73,0:04:28.57,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那就让我看看你们都说了什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:29.34,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,为啥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:32.94,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,毕竟是悠你  肯定回信息也像个刺头吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:33.86,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\pos(822,56)}太远了不过来也行的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7\pos(1100,90)}就算多远我也会去的！\N我会火速完成工作赶过去！\N我可以去帐篷那边吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7\pos(948,220)}可以啊\N  随你喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35\pos(1076,320)}谢谢你  \NF4排位赛结束后我应该\N就能过去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7\pos(1006,444)}排位赛辛苦了！\N我也过去帐篷那边了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35\pos(1078,546)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\pos(1088,684)}比赛前的事抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:35.74,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,3分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:36.79,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,为什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.91,0:04:39.86,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不过就悠来说也算是够直率了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.95,0:04:43.38,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是一直还是未读
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:46.13,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你好  这里是小牧Motors
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:49.26,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你好你好  一直以来受你关照了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:52.44,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,对的  对的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:55.39,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哈？怎么这么突然
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:58.53,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,什么都决定了  那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:02.70,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,叔叔？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:04.15,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,发生什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:07.53,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,三日月饮料那边…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:11.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,撤回赞助到底是怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:14.78,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,小牧Motors的表现一直在变好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:17.41,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,这么下去肯定有希望获得胜利的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.65,0:05:18.44,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.56,0:05:19.91,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那个  等下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:21.75,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,如果原因是之前那次退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.75,0:05:24.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那都是因为我觉得状况危险才阻止他们的  所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.55,0:05:25.41,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:29.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不是这样的  真贺先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.67,0:05:34.92,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,抱歉我来迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:38.52,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,这件事就由我来说明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:42.93,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真贺孝哉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:48.05,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,以前是用雪平孝哉这一名字来进行工作的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.35,0:05:51.94,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真贺先生所拍摄的  悠的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:56.76,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,发布那张照片之后  我们公司收到了好几宗质询
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:06:05.88,overtake newspaper,,0,0,0,,{\fs95\an7\frz40.28\pos(-34,590)}为了拍摄照片见死\N不救？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:06:05.88,overtake newspaper,,0,0,0,,{\an7\frz40.28\pos(217.6,497.2)}摄影师\N雪平孝哉的真面目
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:06:00.38,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,询问三日月饮料是否雇佣了了十年前震灾时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:05.72,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,进行非人道行为的人来拍摄广告照片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:08.10,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,拍摄这张照片的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:12.75,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真贺先生  是你没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:15.43,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:19.73,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是  悠跟这件事没有任何关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.10,0:06:21.26,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,如果问题在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:24.03,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那我保证今后不会参与任何贵社的广告
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:26.46,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,所以  赞助方面还请您…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.01,0:06:26.79,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,{\an8}真贺先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.15,0:06:32.59,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,现在还未引起大的骚动
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:35.54,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但要是被媒体盯上  引起大骚乱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:37.65,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,这可是事关弊公司的形象的负面事件
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:45.63,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是十分抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:49.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,等下等下  雪平小姐请你抬起头来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.03,0:06:52.18,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不  这次的事归根结底
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:58.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,原因都是我没有跟三日月饮料说明清楚真贺的经历
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.35,0:07:02.53,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那个  那之后真贺有联系你们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.53,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不…没有跟我联系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:09.53,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是十分抱歉  本来他应该要跟我一起来才对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.69,0:07:13.64,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,没办法啦没办法啦  他现在应该很自责吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:19.61,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,话说回来那张震灾的照片  没想到拍摄的人是真贺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:24.27,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,确实引起过一番骚动  我看见照片就回想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.80,0:07:27.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,当时电视节目上狠狠抨击了他一整天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:28.80,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,这么严重吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:34.96,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,说什么伦理之类的  有拍照的时间为什么不去救她什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:40.04,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哈？那个情况下  就算不拍照也救不到那个女孩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.30,0:07:42.32,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是光凭一张嘴说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:45.84,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但那确实是一张引发了如此冲击的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:50.26,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,事关人命  那就更加如此了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:05.96,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\an7\frz6.009\1c&H18161D&\move(970,156,934,-70,1615,1823)}可以啊  \N随你喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:06.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\an7\frz6.009\1c&H18161D&\move(1266,504,1182,-62,1740,1990)}谢谢你  \NF4排位赛结束后我应该\N就能过去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:06.46,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\an7\frz6.009\1c&H18161D&\move(978,824,856,-104,63,480)}排位赛辛苦了！\N我也过去帐篷那边了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:08.13,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\an7\frz6.009\1c&H18161D&\move(1490,1000,1368,86,0,360)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:08.13,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\an7\frz6.009\1c&H18161D&\move(1068,1036,980,340,0,322)}比赛前的事抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:08.13,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\an7\frz6.009\1c&H18161D&\move(962,1018,922,676,0,192)}锢太和叔叔都很担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.59,0:08:09.98,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,悠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:51.07,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,车手冲线
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:57.09,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,第一名是Belsorriso的新任一号车手  德丸俊轨
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.85,0:09:11.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那么  一起祝贺德丸先生的一号车手揭幕战以及首个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:13.45,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,干杯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:15.56,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,干杯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:17.65,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,{\an8}恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:19.66,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,{\an8}辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:20.27,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,结谷前辈您也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:23.69,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,二号车手揭幕战拿到第三名  真是恭喜你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:24.97,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:27.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  我有一瞬间还以为自己不行了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:29.65,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,没想到运气这么好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:32.06,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是差一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.19,0:09:33.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,运气好？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.05,0:09:38.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真厉害  你是靠运气才站上颁奖台的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:39.60,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不…那个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:41.05,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,十分抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.84,0:09:44.14,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:46.95,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,毕竟我也一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:51.34,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,要是早月没有受伤  今天我也不会作为一号车手出战了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:54.19,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.19,0:09:55.76,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是啊  德丸果然很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.75,0:09:57.21,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:10:00.18,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,今天完全是我的调校有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:01.92,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,锢太你没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:04.39,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是我说要减少练习时间的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:07.57,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,减少练习  调校肯定会变得更难做的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.53,0:10:13.60,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,要不还是恢复以前的练习时间？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.86,0:10:15.60,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,轮胎也还有些富余…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:16.32,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:17.66,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:18.74,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.25,0:10:21.31,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,没有赞助的时候也一直这么过来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:24.98,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,前段时间只是偶尔运气好而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:33.61,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:35.75,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,看见悠了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:39.68,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,去送晚报了  说今天开始继续打工了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:41.49,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:42.16,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:46.06,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我在想我们这样子真的好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:46.87,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你指什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:51.83,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢  已经见到了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:55.10,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,看到了悠表现这么出色的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:11:01.01,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,让人忍不住就产生期待了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:03.69,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,会遐想很多事情啊  更好的成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:07.19,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,虽然这都是我自私的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:10.22,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不过这种事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.99,0:11:12.80,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:14.02,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:16.76,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,欢迎  我说悠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:17.66,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,锢太
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:19.42,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,跟你说点事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.63,0:11:22.97,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:26.97,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那是什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:32.15,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不…就是找你商量点事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.70,0:11:34.05,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.93,0:11:37.71,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,其实我也有点事想跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:38.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.79,0:11:42.10,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你先说啦  是你叫我来聊聊的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.38,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是之前比赛的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:47.84,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不是  是关于那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.93,0:11:50.58,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:54.78,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,孝哉  还是一直联系不到他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:58.18,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:02.23,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是因为赞助商的事还在自责消沉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:05.24,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,其实我根本不觉得那是小真贺的错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:06.46,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:10.33,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,话说  错的是当时乱说话的那群人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:12.25,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,可恶的伪君子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.72,0:12:16.98,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那家伙  可能又拍不出照片了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.44,0:12:22.21,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:25.07,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:27.67,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我是知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:28.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:30.39,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那张照片的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:35.10,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,知道那家伙以前发生过什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:39.02,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,而我却自认为了解他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:41.39,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但其实我完全不懂他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:45.04,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,要是我能早一些调查照片的事就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.69,0:12:53.32,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那样就能更加了解他  更加了解他所说的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:57.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,为什么我总是事后才明白
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:12:58.95,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:02.12,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,这样就跟老爸那时候一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:08.02,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,想太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:10.12,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:14.18,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你想太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:23.41,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,话说  要是想了这么多  那直接跟他说不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:26.74,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是…我也联系不上他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.92,0:13:29.04,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,向冴小姐问他的住址
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.46,0:13:32.23,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是…但是我该说什么好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:36.38,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是的  把刚才你说的话直接告诉他不就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哎  好像这话我之前也说过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:44.50,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,话说  锢太你想说的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.77,0:13:46.30,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,之后再跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:22.75,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,终终终终于来探望早月了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.06,0:14:24.85,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,怎么办怎么办  我该说什么好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:27.54,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,虽然小锢太说  我直接跟他说那些话就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:30.22,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但直接是怎么直接？怎么样直接
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:34.56,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,{\an8}好开心  谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:35.94,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好  排好队哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:39.02,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,早月  我想要两张呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:41.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那就重新排队啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好好  别吵架啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.69,0:14:45.57,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我会按顺序给你们签名的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:48.65,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不过每人一天只能拿一张哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.09,0:14:52.32,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,想要第二张的话就请明天再来哦  明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:53.71,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.71,0:14:55.30,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,什  什…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.73,0:14:58.99,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,什么情况啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:00.93,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,早月  再见了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.03,0:15:02.27,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,明天我也会来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:04.68,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好  回家注意安全哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.47,0:15:10.60,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不知不觉就暴露了我在哪个医院了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:16.65,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不过没想到不在比赛出场也有人给我加油  真是令人感激
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:20.14,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:24.56,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那个  这是慰问品
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.68,0:15:26.94,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是水果  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:29.76,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不不  只是些简单的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:32.97,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,欸  我喜欢苹果  我好开心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.35,0:15:39.38,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你比想象中的要精神呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.49,0:15:41.76,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,嗯  只是骨折而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.24,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,完全没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:45.53,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好疼…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:47.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不能勉强自己哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.77,0:15:50.79,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,肋骨和左脚要三个月才会完全恢复呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:54.73,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不过骨折好了之后我打算立马就回归赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:16:01.71,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是医生叮嘱说  一发现我勉强自己就要延长住院时间呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.24,0:16:04.72,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哎  好想赶紧复健啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.72,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好想活动活动身体啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:11.88,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那你平时都做什么呢…请问
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.25,0:16:13.39,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不用说敬语啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:15.66,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我想想  平时啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:23.57,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,跟粉丝女孩子聊天  给粉丝女孩子签名  跟粉丝女孩子打牌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:26.76,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,还有看F4的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.81,0:16:32.70,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,之前的比赛你去了吗  很精彩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:35.60,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,阿俊作为一号车手获胜了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:36.98,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.31,0:16:44.47,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那个  但是我…没有早月的比赛…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.47,0:16:47.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,没有我的比赛也跑得相当好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.41,0:16:50.19,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:52.51,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,吓了一跳呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:57.17,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我还想要赶紧回归赛场呢  看来也不用了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:17:00.99,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是因为天才不在了  给车队带来危机感了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.65,0:17:06.85,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,还是说  其实没有我也完全没所谓呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:08.23,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,才没有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:10.95,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  我的运气也到头了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:12.21,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:25.45,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,还没走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:27.31,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,笑生先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:28.45,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,很用心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:31.72,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  擅自用了这个房间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:33.06,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:36.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,怎么了  有什么在意的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:41.30,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:44.32,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,结谷有一瞬间掉到了第五位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.77,0:17:50.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,虽然在下一个弯反超回来了  但那只是因为前面的车失误了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:52.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,并不是因为他速度快
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:53.72,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真严格啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:57.88,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哪里严格了  如果我是二号车手  绝对不会犯这种错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:01.43,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但目前已经没有我这个水平的车手了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:03.43,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,他们不符合我们的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.17,0:18:07.71,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,别这么说嘛  你也可以给他们一些建议的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:12.25,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,笑生先生  我十分感谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:18.61,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,如果我没被Belsorriso选上  我现在估计已经放弃赛车了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:28.68,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但正因如此  我不能永远待在F4里  我已经19岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.18,0:18:32.00,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我要早点做出成绩  往下一个地方前进了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.01,0:18:35.24,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,结谷和加贺山都是好小伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:37.69,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但他们不是我的朋友  而是对手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:41.85,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我没义务照顾他们  也没有这个精力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:43.92,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我做不到这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.32,0:18:46.52,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,春永却这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.27,0:18:50.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,他在赛后经常给他们提建议
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:54.17,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但他从来没有跟我说过什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:58.01,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,因为不需要吧  他经常称赞你跑得好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:03.21,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,别太着急了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:05.43,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,一号车手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\an7\frz10.09\pos(1106,80)\1a&H50}谢谢你  \NF4排位赛结束后我应该\N就能过去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\an7\frz9.846\pos(1036.4,292.4)\1a&H50}排位赛辛苦了！\N我也过去帐篷那边了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\frz10.42\1a&H50\pos(1239.6,444.4)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\frz10.78\pos(1249.6,520.8)\1a&H50}比赛前的事抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1240.4,635.6)\frz10.28\1a&H50}锢太和叔叔都很担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\frz9.95\pos(1296.8,728.8)\1a&H50}我现在到你家来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:35.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你在吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:38.18,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你不开门也没事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:42.66,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,如果你在的话  我希望你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:51.21,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那个  我不知道该说什么才好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:57.84,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,之前雨赛时你说的话  我十分感激
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:02.66,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但那个时候我什么都不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.85,0:20:07.00,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不仅是那次的事  迄今为止的事情也都是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.94,0:20:12.11,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你突然跑过来  说什么要支持我  做了一堆奇奇怪怪的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:15.42,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,没想到却真的帮我们找到了赞助
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:17.88,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我都很感谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:22.02,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,如果没有你  没有孝哉你的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.02,0:20:23.86,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,有些跑法我甚至无法做出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.36,0:20:29.03,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,如果是因为赞助的事情觉得无法面对我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.16,0:20:30.58,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那些事情根本没所谓的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:33.63,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,小牧叔叔和锢太都不在意这些
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.97,0:20:34.98,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我也完全…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:45.21,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:49.11,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,很抱歉现在才正式跟你道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:55.29,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,现在才理解那时候你为什么阻止我  真的对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:59.19,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,明明我知道你以前发生过什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:01.31,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,却仍然不理解你的做法  真的对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:05.47,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我知道我这么说很自私
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:08.12,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,而且我也不知道现在自己到底能做到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.13,0:21:11.05,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是那个约定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.59,0:21:14.17,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我获胜的时候你要帮我拍照的约定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:16.50,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,可以的话我还是想要实现它
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:22.54,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,孝哉？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.57,0:21:27.54,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,孝哉在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:31.64,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:08.99,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,孝哉？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.51,0:22:11.01,overtake - title1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1088,625)}曝 光 不 足
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.51,0:22:11.01,overtake - title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1118,881)}我的感受
Comment: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:11.69,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,template line,{\fad(300,300)}
Comment: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:11.69,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,template line,{\fad(300,300)}
Comment: 0,0:22:11.69,0:22:15.95,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,シグナルが青に変わる
Comment: 0,0:22:16.14,0:22:20.45,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,迷わずにアクセルを踏み込んで
Comment: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:24.74,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,駆け抜けた　孤独な夜
Comment: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:30.31,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,願いをのせた　一筋のShooting star light
Comment: 0,0:22:30.31,0:22:35.29,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,追い掛ける　僕らの夢
Comment: 0,0:22:37.74,0:22:46.22,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,ループする日常で知らずに擦り減らした心で
Comment: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:54.66,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,まだ信じたい　不可能を可能に　なりふり構わずに
Comment: 0,0:22:54.66,0:23:03.40,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,平坦な道じゃない　後戻りをする事さえ容易じゃない
Comment: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:12.52,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,「頑張った分だけちゃんと報われるといいのにな」ってキミが笑う
Comment: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:17.21,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,疲れたらここへおいで
Comment: 0,0:23:17.21,0:23:25.98,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,スペアのない心で彷徨った眼差しに光が射す
Comment: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:31.73,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,あの日の願いの行方を見届けよう
Comment: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:37.01,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,向こう見ずな僕らのまま
Comment: 0,0:22:11.69,0:22:15.95,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,信号灯变为绿色
Comment: 0,0:22:16.14,0:22:20.45,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,毫不犹豫地踩下踏板
Comment: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:24.74,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,穿过孤独的夜晚
Comment: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:30.31,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,承载着梦想  一股劲地像光一样往前冲
Comment: 0,0:22:30.31,0:22:35.29,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,去追逐我们的梦想吧
Comment: 0,0:22:37.74,0:22:46.22,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,被无尽循环的日常悄然磨损着的内心
Comment: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:54.66,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,不论如何仍然相信  能把不可能化为现实
Comment: 0,0:22:54.66,0:23:03.40,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,这不是平坦的道路  无法轻易回头
Comment: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:12.52,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,你笑着说道「希望付出的努力能得到回报」
Comment: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:17.21,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果累了就到这里来吧
Comment: 0,0:23:17.21,0:23:25.98,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,你的目光照亮了彷徨着的早已疲惫的内心
Comment: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:31.73,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,去见证那一天许下的愿望抵达的地方吧
Comment: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:37.01,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,那将仍然是莽撞的我们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,——ED——
